    given-names: Aziz Gökhan
version: "1.0.0-rc1"
date-released: 2026-07-28
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/azizgokhannarin/perfectvaluecubehash"
abstract: >-
  Frozen experimental 256-bit hash candidate based on a canonical Perfect Value
  Cube, state-dependent intersecting line rotations, reverse foldback, full-cube
  closure, and a four-diagonal squeeze. Published for independent cryptanalysis;
  no security claim is made.
keywords:
  - cryptographic hash
  - experimental cryptography
  - cryptanalysis
  - perfect value cube
  - rotation-based hash
